 is consistent with existing UI\\n- [ ] All existing tests continue to pass\\n- [ ] New tests added for clear functionality cover edge cases\\n- [ ] Component remains accessible (keyboard, screen readers)\\n\\n## Technical Notes\\n- Component location: `src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/ProblemInputForm.jsx`\\n- Test location: `src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/ProblemInputForm.test.jsx`\\n- Styling: Tailwind CSS utility classes\\n- State management: React useState hook\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01GhQf9A2FeQFrDgdHdBuSh6', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'get_summary', 'project_id': 'ongoing-implementation'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01GhQf9A2FeQFrDgdHdBuSh6', 'content': '{"success": true, "summary": {"error": "Project not found"}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01TuytBPb7ZPrLg95H6V4LvX', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Complete Ongoing Implementation Tasks', 'description': 'Analyze and complete the existing work that appears to be in progress based on current repository state and output files'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01TuytBPb7ZPrLg95H6V4LvX', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "0e09c71f", "message": "Created project: Complete Ongoing Implementation Tasks", "summary": {"project_id": "0e09c71f", "project_name": "Complete Ongoing Implementation Tasks", "description": "Analyze and complete the existing work that appears to be in progress based on current repository state and output files", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-17T17:20:54.942349", "updated_at": "2026-01-17T17:20:54.942349", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-17T17