{"timestamp": "2026-01-17 17:25:46", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-31febfd4-a61d-4095-be89-eddaef3c3c4d', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "problem_description": "The Smart Task Decomposition Engine has been implemented (src/runtime/agents/decomposition_engine.py) and tested successfully, but the API endpoints are missing from the backend to expose this functionality to the frontend.\\n\\nNeed to add 3 API endpoints to src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py:\\n\\n1. POST /api/decompose - accepts user task and returns decomposition plan\\n2. POST /api/approve-plan - handles approve/reject/modify actions  \\n3. GET /api/decomposition-history - returns historical decompositions and accuracy metrics\\n\\nThe decomposition engine is already fully functional with these key classes:\\n- TaskDecompositionEngine (main engine)\\n- TaskAnalysis, DecompositionPlan, ResourceEstimate, AllocationPlan, Schedule (data models)\\n\\nThe endpoints should:\\n- Import and use the existing decomposition engine\\n- Follow the same patterns as other API endpoints in main.py\\n- Include proper error handling and logging\\n- Use Pydantic models for request/response validation\\n- Return consistent JSON responses\\n\\nLocation: Add the endpoints after the existing API endpoints but before the uvicorn server startup section at the end.\\n\\nThe implementation should integrate seamlessly with the existing backend architecture.",\n  "output_file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py",\n  "acceptance_criteria": [\n    "Three new API endpoints added to main.py",\n    "Proper import of decomposition engine",\n    "Pydantic request/response models defined",\n    "Error handling and logging included",